WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.237
Time: 3 minutes.

00:00:01.477 --> 00:00:04.421
Perform a short usability review before publishing.

00:00:04.661 --> 00:00:08.117
Give a reviewer the fictional delayed-export packet and the draft.

00:00:08.357 --> 00:00:16.080
Ask them to identify the next action at 6 minutes, 12 minutes, and Failed status without explaining the procedure verbally.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:20.203
Any point where they must guess is an opportunity to improve the text.

00:00:20.893 --> 00:00:27.655
Worked review finding: the reviewer cannot identify the support owner because the draft uses a first name only.

00:00:27.895 --> 00:00:32.183
Replace that with the approved role or stable team contact destination.

00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:37.074
Check each link and remove placeholder destinations before a production release.

00:00:37.314 --> 00:00:43.629
In this sample, destinations remain clearly identified as fictional rather than fabricated live links.

00:00:44.319 --> 00:00:51.167
Publish the page when the authorized review is complete; later edits use the available update or publish action.

00:00:51.407 --> 00:00:55.055
Check the rendered page, heading order, links, and intended audience.

00:00:55.295 --> 00:01:00.308
A saved editing session is not evidence that the published page shows the changes.

00:01:00.548 --> 00:01:06.841
A content status label can explain maturity but does not by itself prove a substantive review occurred.

00:01:07.531 --> 00:01:11.670
Verify with an intended reader or an approved access-check process.

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:13.787
Do not ask for someone’s credentials.

00:01:14.027 --> 00:01:24.267
A final message should link the canonical page and summarize what changed, using only the audience and communication authorization your organization provides.

00:01:24.957 --> 00:01:26.045
Now it's your turn.

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:29.720
Your edit is saved, but the reader sees the old instructions.

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.304
What should you check first?

00:01:31.544 --> 00:01:34.659
Pause the video and make your choice in the activity below.

